  {
    "id": 2018003010020,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "こんなにいい天気だってのに、\r\nこの後ずーっとレッスンなんて……めんどくさぁ……",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800301/2018003010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "冬優子……今はそうしてだらだらしていてもいいけど、\r\nレッスンでは、ちゃんとしないとだめだぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003010030,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "うっさいわねー……\r\n面倒なもんは面倒なんだもん",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800301/2018003010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003010040,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "だいたい、アイドルのレッスンって\r\nなんであんなにハードなのよ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800301/2018003010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003010050,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ふゆはちゃんとリズム通り、\r\n間違えずに踊れてるってのに",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800301/2018003010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003010060,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "『指が伸びてない』とか、『姿勢が悪い』とか",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "r",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800301/2018003010060",
    "voiceKeep": true
  },
  {
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "細かいとこまで言われるし……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "正しく踊れてればいいってわけじゃないんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003010070,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "正しいだけじゃダメ……\r\n面倒な話ねぇ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800301/2018003010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003010080,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "もっと簡単に……いっそレッスンしないで\r\n上手くなれる方法とかないの？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800301/2018003010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あるわけないだろ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003010090,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "はぁ……\r\nま、そうよねぇ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800301/2018003010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003010100,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……これはもしもの話だけど……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "r",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800301/2018003010100",
    "voiceKeep": true
  },
  {
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "今『ふゆ、頭痛くなっちゃった』って言ったら……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "休ませないぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003010110,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ちぇっ……\r\nこの鬼プロデューサー！　人でなし！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800301/2018003010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんとでも言え",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（うーん、やる気がないな……\r\nもうすぐレッスンが始まるけど、大丈夫なのか？）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003010120,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "あーあ……\r\nったく……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800301/2018003010120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "冬優子、気持ちはわかるが──\r\nって、どこに行くんだ？",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "se": "0242"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003010130,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "どこって……\r\nそりゃ、レッスンスタジオに決まってんでしょ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/201800301/2018003010130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003010140,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "そろそろ行かなきゃ\r\n遅刻しちゃうじゃない",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800301/2018003010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……あ、ああ、そうだよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003010150,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……？\r\n何よ、その反応",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800301/2018003010150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003010160,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "あ、もしかして\r\nふゆがレッスンサボるとか思った？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800301/2018003010160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、それは…………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003010170,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……まあ……確かに、\r\nふゆも、ちょっと愚痴りすぎたかもだけど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800301/2018003010170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003010180,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "レッスンなんてダルいし面倒だし、\r\nやらないで済むならやるわけないけど……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800301/2018003010180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003010190,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "そんな甘っちょろいこと言ってたら\r\nトップアイドルになれないもん、仕方ないでしょ",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800301/2018003010190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（あれだけやる気なさそうにして……\r\n実は、すごく真面目なんだよな）",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003010200,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……なによ？",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800301/2018003010200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや……\r\nこの後のレッスン──",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "頑張れ、冬優子",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "楽しんでこよう",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "無理はしないようにな",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003010210,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "トーゼンでしょ\r\nどうせやるんだったら思いっきりやるわよ",
    "charAnim1": "anger3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800301/2018003010210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003010220,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "疲れて終わり、なんて絶対嫌だし！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800301/2018003010220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは。その意気なら、レッスンも仕事も\r\nいいものになりそうだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003010230,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "もちろんよ。トレーナーもスタッフもファンも\r\nみーんなびっくりさせてやるから！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800301/2018003010230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003010240,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "あんたも、しっかり見てなさいよ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800301/2018003010240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003010250,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "明日のふゆは、今日のふゆより\r\nずっとずっとすごいふゆになるの！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800301/2018003010250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003010260,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "そんでそんで、どんどんトップアイドル目指して\r\n突っ走るんだから……",
    "charAnim1": "anger3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800301/2018003010260"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003010270,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "一瞬だって、止まってなんかあげないんだからね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800301/2018003010270"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003010280,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "えっ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800301/2018003010280"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003010290,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……レッスンなのに、楽しんでいいわけ？",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800301/2018003010290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ\r\nでも遊び半分でやれってわけじゃないぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "楽しむのは『歌が上手くなること』や\r\n『踊れなかったところが踊れるようになること』だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうして問題をひとつずつ解決していったら……\r\nきっと、レッスンそのものも楽しくなるはずだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003010300,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "そっか……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800301/2018003010300"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003010310,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……あははっ！\r\nそれなら、誰よりも楽しんでやる！",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800301/2018003010310"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よし、その意気だ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003010320,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ふふん、でも後悔しないでよね\r\nふゆはやるならとことんやってやるタイプなの",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800301/2018003010320"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003010330,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "その時になって……\r\n楽しみすぎ、なんて言っても遅いんだから！",
    "charAnim1": "anger3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800301/2018003010330"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003010340,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "わかってる\r\n頑張ったけど怪我しました、じゃプロ失格でしょ？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800301/2018003010340"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003010350,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "怪我なんかして、ふゆのスターダムへの道が\r\n遠のいっちゃったら意味ないもん！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800301/2018003010350"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、冬優子らしいな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "しかし、そこまでわかってるなら\r\n心配する必要はなかったな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003010360,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "まあね\r\nでも、そういうこと考えるのがあんたの仕事だし？",
    "charAnim1": "anger3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800301/2018003010360"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018003010370,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "心配くらいはさせてあげる",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "r",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800301/2018003010370",
    "voiceKeep": true
  },
  {
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "せいぜいふゆのこと、いーっぱい、考えなさい！",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
